   "subject": "Re: support for multigraph",
   "parts": [
    [
     1,
     "<div style=\"word-wrap:break-word\">Robert<div><br></div><div>You can use <span style=\"color:rgb(6,26,153);font-family:Courier;font-size:19.9px\">addGraphToGraph.</span><div><div><br></div><div>Below are two functions that you may find useful; &quot;loadedges&quot; illustrates how addGraphToGraph may be used.</div><div><br></div><div>Mark</div><div><br></div><div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier\">plot.cy.2<span style=\"color:rgb(6,26,153)\"> &lt;- </span><span style=\"color:rgb(195,136,9)\">function</span><span style=\"color:rgb(6,26,153)\"> (</span>cytoscape.file<span style=\"color:rgb(6,26,153)\">, </span>edge.file<span style=\"color:rgb(6,26,153)\">) {</span></div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">mydata</span> &lt;- new(<span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;graphNEL&quot;</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">edgemode</span>=<span style=\"color:#b01600\">&#39;directed&#39;</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">nodes</span>=as.character(<span style=\"color:#000000\">cytoscape.file</span>[, <span style=\"color:#045218\">1</span>]))</div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier;color:rgb(79,79,79)\">#<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>Set up and load all the node attributes</div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span><span style=\"color:#c38809\">for</span> (<span style=\"color:#000000\">i</span> <span style=\"color:#c38809\">in</span> <span style=\"color:#045218\">2</span>:ncol(<span style=\"color:#000000\">cytoscape.file</span>)) {</div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span><span style=\"color:#c38809\">if</span> (class(<span style=\"color:#000000\">cytoscape.file</span>[<span style=\"color:#045218\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#000000\">i</span>]) != <span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;numeric&quot;</span>) {</div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier\"><span style=\"color:#061a99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span></span>mydata<span style=\"color:#061a99\"> &lt;- initNodeAttribute (</span>graph<span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span>mydata<span style=\"color:#061a99\">,  </span><a href=\"http://attribute.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://attribute.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244540268000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0eCz_G59w0Zb5c6hBB_rSv\">attribute.name</a><span style=\"color:#061a99\">=names(</span>cytoscape.file<span style=\"color:#061a99\">[</span>i<span style=\"color:#061a99\">]), </span>attribute.type<span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\">&#39;char&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">, </span>default.value<span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#045218\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">)</span></div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span>nodeData (<span style=\"color:#000000\">mydata</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">n</span>=as.character(<span style=\"color:#000000\">cytoscape.file</span>[, <span style=\"color:#045218\">1</span>]), <span style=\"color:#000000\">attr</span>=names(<span style=\"color:#000000\">cytoscape.file</span>[<span style=\"color:#000000\">i</span>])) &lt;- as.character(<span style=\"color:#000000\">cytoscape.file</span>[,<span style=\"color:#000000\">i</span>])<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>}</div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span><span style=\"color:#c38809\">if</span> (class(<span style=\"color:#000000\">cytoscape.file</span>[<span style=\"color:#045218\">1</span>,<span style=\"color:#000000\">i</span>])==<span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;numeric&quot;</span>) {<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier\"><span style=\"color:#061a99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span></span>mydata<span style=\"color:#061a99\"> &lt;- initNodeAttribute (</span>graph<span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span>mydata<span style=\"color:#061a99\">,  </span><a href=\"http://attribute.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://attribute.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244540268000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0eCz_G59w0Zb5c6hBB_rSv\">attribute.name</a><span style=\"color:#061a99\">=names(</span>cytoscape.file<span style=\"color:#061a99\">[</span>i<span style=\"color:#061a99\">]), </span>attribute.type<span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\">&#39;numeric&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">, </span>default.value<span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#045218\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">) </span></div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>nodeData (<span style=\"color:#000000\">mydata</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">n</span>=as.character(<span style=\"color:#000000\">cytoscape.file</span>[, <span style=\"color:#045218\">1</span>]), <span style=\"color:#000000\">attr</span>=names(<span style=\"color:#000000\">cytoscape.file</span>[<span style=\"color:#000000\">i</span>])) &lt;- as.numeric(<span style=\"color:#000000\">cytoscape.file</span>[,<span style=\"color:#000000\">i</span>]) } </div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>}</div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier;color:rgb(79,79,79)\"><span style=\"color:#061a99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span></span># load standard edge attributes</div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier\"><span style=\"color:#061a99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span></span>mydata<span style=\"color:#061a99\"> &lt;- initEdgeAttribute (</span>graph<span style=\"color:#061a99\">= </span>mydata<span style=\"color:#061a99\">, </span><a href=\"http://attribute.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://attribute.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244540268000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0eCz_G59w0Zb5c6hBB_rSv\">attribute.name</a><span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\">&#39;edgeType&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">, </span>attribute.type<span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\">&#39;char&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">, </span>default.value<span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\">&#39;undefined&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">)</span></div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier\"><span style=\"color:#061a99\"> <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span></span>mydata<span style=\"color:#061a99\"> &lt;- initEdgeAttribute(</span>mydata<span style=\"color:#061a99\">, </span><a href=\"http://attribute.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://attribute.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244540268000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0eCz_G59w0Zb5c6hBB_rSv\">attribute.name</a><span style=\"color:#061a99\"> = </span><span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;Weight&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">, </span>attribute.type<span style=\"color:#061a99\"> = </span><span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;numeric&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">, </span>default.value<span style=\"color:#061a99\"> = </span><span style=\"color:#045218\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">)</span></div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"> <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">mydata</span> = addEdge (as.vector(<span style=\"color:#000000\">edge.file</span>$<span style=\"color:#000000\">Gene.1</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">mode</span>=<span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;character&quot;</span>), as.vector(<span style=\"color:#000000\">edge.file</span>$<span style=\"color:#000000\">Gene.2</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">mode</span>=<span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;character&quot;</span>), <span style=\"color:#000000\">mydata</span>) </div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"> <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>edgeData (<span style=\"color:#000000\">mydata</span>, as.vector(<span style=\"color:#000000\">edge.file</span>$<span style=\"color:#000000\">Gene.1</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">mode</span>=<span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;character&quot;</span>), as.vector(<span style=\"color:#000000\">edge.file</span>$<span style=\"color:#000000\">Gene.2</span>, <span style=\"color:#000000\">mode</span>=<span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;character&quot;</span>), <span style=\"color:#000000\">attr</span>=<span style=\"color:#b01600\">&#39;edgeType&#39;</span>) &lt;- as.character(<span style=\"color:#000000\">edge.file</span>$<span style=\"color:#000000\">edgeType</span>)</div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier\"><span style=\"color:#061a99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>edgeData (</span>mydata<span style=\"color:#061a99\">, as.vector(</span>edge.file<span style=\"color:#061a99\">$</span>Gene.1<span style=\"color:#061a99\">, </span>mode<span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;character&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">), as.vector(</span>edge.file<span style=\"color:#061a99\">$</span>Gene.2<span style=\"color:#061a99\">, </span>mode<span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;character&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">), </span>attr<span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\">&#39;Weight&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">) &lt;- </span>edge.file<span style=\"color:#061a99\">$</span>Weight</div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span>return(<span style=\"color:#000000\">mydata</span>)<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>}</div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\">#</span></div></div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"><br></span></div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\"><br></span></div><div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier\"><span style=\"color:#061a99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span></span>loadedges<span style=\"color:#061a99\"> &lt;- </span><span style=\"color:#c38809\">function</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\"> (</span>Cy_Wind<span style=\"color:#061a99\">, </span>Network.File<span style=\"color:#061a99\">) {</span></div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier\"><span style=\"color:#061a99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span></span>filename<span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#c38809\">NULL</span></div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span> <span style=\"color:#000000\">a</span> = as.character(<span style=\"color:#000000\">Network.File</span>$<span style=\"color:#000000\">Gene.1</span>)</div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span> <span style=\"color:#000000\">b</span> = as.character(<span style=\"color:#000000\">Network.File</span> $<span style=\"color:#000000\">Gene.2</span>)</div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span><span style=\"color:#000000\">nodenames</span> &lt;- unique(c(<span style=\"color:#000000\">a</span>,<span style=\"color:#000000\">b</span>))<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span></div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier\"><span style=\"color:#061a99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span></span>edgeTypes<span style=\"color:#061a99\"> &lt;- levels(as.factor(</span>Network.File<span style=\"color:#061a99\">$</span>edgeType<span style=\"color:#061a99\">))</span></div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier\"><span style=\"color:#061a99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span></span>sepedges<span style=\"color:#061a99\"> &lt;- dlply(</span>Network.File<span style=\"color:#061a99\">, .(</span>edgeType<span style=\"color:#061a99\">)) </span></div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier\"><span style=\"color:#061a99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span></span>subgraph2<span style=\"color:#061a99\"> &lt;- new(</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;graphNEL&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">, </span>nodes<span style=\"color:#061a99\">= </span>nodenames<span style=\"color:#061a99\">, </span>edgemode<span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\">&#39;undirected&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">)</span></div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier\"><span style=\"color:#061a99\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span></span>subgraph2<span style=\"color:#061a99\"> &lt;- initEdgeAttribute (</span>graph<span style=\"color:#061a99\">= </span>subgraph2<span style=\"color:#061a99\">, </span><a href=\"http://attribute.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://attribute.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244540268000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0eCz_G59w0Zb5c6hBB_rSv\">attribute.name</a><span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\">&#39;edgeType&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">, </span>attribute.type<span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\">&#39;char&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">, </span>default.value<span style=\"color:#061a99\">=</span><span style=\"color:#b01600\">&#39;undefined&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">)</span></div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier\"><span style=\"color:#061a99\"> <span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span></span>subgraph2<span style=\"color:#061a99\"> &lt;- initEdgeAttribute(</span>subgraph2<span style=\"color:#061a99\">, </span><a href=\"http://attribute.name\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://attribute.name&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793244540268000&amp;usg=AOvVaw0eCz_G59w0Zb5c6hBB_rSv\">attribute.name</a><span style=\"color:#061a99\"> = </span><span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;Weight&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">, </span>attribute.type<span style=\"color:#061a99\"> = </span><span style=\"color:#b01600\">&quot;numeric&quot;</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">, </span>default.value<span style=\"color:#061a99\"> = </span><span style=\"color:#045218\">0.0</span><span style=\"color:#061a99\">)</span></div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span><span style=\"color:#4f4f4f\">#</span></div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier;color:rgb(6,26,153)\"><span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t\t\t</span><span style=\"color:#c38809\">for</span>(<span style=\"color:#000000\">i</span> <span style=\"color:#c38809\">in</span> <span style=\"color:#045218\">1</span>:length(<span style=\"color:#000000\">sepedges</span>))<span style=\"white-space:pre\">\t</span>{</div><div style=\"margin:0px 0px 0px 4px;font-family:Courier;color:rgb(6,2